{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:19fa9482794bcad9f9e9b58a94e0f579e3a4587671bd2e6cec274cc435125060",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:885ff181bf8db5bc2d96257322847ccef0e8a1e4bc9e28f6c16922070cd095f2",
      "text": "淋上满满的枫糖浆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef3be77f2ddc950b6ef1147e68125f0965befa259a2d7a15a0c5a6a0f2884b6f",
      "text": "工作结束回家的路上，英雄和制作人发现了一家排着长队的店铺。那里正是英雄之前关注过的、最近大热的松饼店。机会难得，两人决定去吃松饼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:885ff181bf8db5bc2d96257322847ccef0e8a1e4bc9e28f6c16922070cd095f2",
      "text": "淋上满满的枫糖浆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1b9c458491485c9ac992b65e9dbc27cfbeb541cd9594ef785b0024fcc2599d5",
      "text": "录制辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecfc1718370edf1a107a57465018f1d5cf75cb5a3b3f22cb5617a07cb76808a0",
      "text": "啊啊，辛苦了。\n今天的录制也很顺利，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b691d5e28af9645ace1ff2c386779baa1fda81aeb01869f02b9ed1fbc4d75c6",
      "text": "是啊。很期待播出……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6ab583deae619e2a7ff81f8dea8b1e80de4aed8f5871668f74193898769d283",
      "text": "怎么了吗，制作人？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e68d9ae6e12ae099e4f2412574a0f48ad45697027aa5d2cce840c9898b4e5ec9",
      "text": "啊，不好意思。因为看到那边排着长队，\n不由得……一定是很出名的店吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e991213aa9f08423c16450b62d6ecd548446e64269b01ab18e1479f0a62f21",
      "text": "嗯？……啊啊，那里啊。\n是最近电视上很有人气的松饼店呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d69808538a270be012ec25401177a52163ecf9390ffd57c41782dbba1ae69f3",
      "text": "我之前也在杂志上看到过，留意了一下。\n这样啊，原来是在这附近啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa931b2f4bb440bf0a771d4ffb19c06f45d8ca19c9b8c1af6c3ded9cbd2ebb92",
      "text": "今天的工作已经结束了，\n机会难得，要顺道去看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cebc3920ef0e59ed34fd60b64cf74d5e55ff1283ba894031faa17b3531b983c8",
      "text": "可以吗？那我们去吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1760fa545f60e77605d46c2816a8eb0217ce4a70de85c3f854fad0e4351239e",
      "text": "谢谢你邀请我。\n这家店我一直想着什么时候来一次呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf1d13891e90a53132e1df1f65d60aa85e0a4cfa3478fa97f331cf3a7801e0ff",
      "text": "不过看起来还要排一会儿队啊。趁现在看看菜单决定点什么吧。稍微等我一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9382ae2b03688dc0f24872f403cd6b9f5c438457c7e3a678239854b9898acf3",
      "text": "查一下店名……\n……找到了。喏，这就是菜单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d321020705d4ba2ba52b9fd2afd9642da9d694155f35fdf731bcb1ecf842931",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n种类真多，配料也很丰富呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e265de0ffeaa652cc202803db9157f436b7932e2eeed9e3f8e9b41c6e01d6e",
      "text": "是啊。听说不管是甜品系还是主食系，\n两边的松饼都很美味，很有话题度呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e508b7f3f849f2f7066fe795c73b55b0b186220d2ef8344770bf771f214333d0",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー选哪种？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eab0bb8eb454580055c6d9d38e6a5f09e0d2422519c4a4e9c76b8468af847498",
      "text": "真纠结啊……\n我选这个期间限定的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faac7f449dc604baeaf7ddba8fae621082db2f51543138b84dc85d8e738553c0",
      "text": "啊，那个我也纠结过！\n看着很好吃啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f108bec255256337cbeaad435a5606892e22e93ae0cd2fd0a892ed942d0d2613",
      "text": "那么我的话……唔——选哪个好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96248c2108b0bb17d04ff00e54ac80de14c5dba107497e5e698c06e3115c6ce7",
      "text": "好，决定了。我就要这个招牌松饼吧。\n现在就已经开始期待吃到了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9be96bbb8acfb69a46a2ba30a7cefa42b604fabe7087a4d49fad1689ee9fab8",
      "text": "真不愧是话题店铺！\n不分男女老少，有各种各样的客人，好热闹啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bc811b7f3532077537006b493a9762a123f0dd5f9d922fe760284b6bf923e60",
      "text": "是啊。要是把来过这里的事\n告诉弟弟们，他们肯定会羡慕的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45f876bbf2892abc5cc13e09b1fc12165833cc9ff7038f680eeb407e5c335164",
      "text": "不是缠着要我带他们来，\n就是缠着要我给他们烤松饼吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce098ff03ca8d7441e1d22066bde97745f9949aecbb33ce12efde80198324314",
      "text": "回去路上顺便买点材料吧。\n家里差不多也快用完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf77977c0769dce10e5279c575c2456d3032f73411157151b06d650e9797227f",
      "text": "英雄先生真是一位温柔的哥哥呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9fc1049f86e9669a196e6e17e34040ea45b3718f3a15467492ee78140f1ffd8",
      "text": "哈哈，是弟弟们太擅长撒娇了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33b933a2d7d1efd54e7a2e3c6e536ee9d1d9d6bbb1da6dcc4b33582cfe0b4f93",
      "text": "我烤的松饼，\n他们总是一个劲夸好吃，添好几片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50a8e181b67b8c3d65a897dba89d06c7781e3d5788b1d0b3596e337835e92db7",
      "text": "制作人要是想吃的话，随时跟我说。\n我可以在事务所的厨房给你烤哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75b00976ee72bd634381acc6458fd371fb4359bd0ba8ba68980e05e84945c517",
      "text": "让您久等了！\n先为您送上本店的招牌松饼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56ab9e92246cf711dade426b2c00a75cf1c362f3d5d8ffa133dda088233fc77b",
      "text": "……哇，看起来超级好吃啊……！\n这到底叠了多少层啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe9b17e1edda40a6f30e10682ad38927a806a5ed6db9cf10ec038d3fb14a44b1",
      "text": "英雄先生，您先请吧。\n请趁热吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ccc494c395cd7ff38db2cc04aed429cb973c949202f3b340c0a20053741e20b",
      "text": "……那、不好意思啦。\n我就先开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d2d52618b7413815b2167ed1883e6d30c0333d5c94b5d393882d42ec30a565f",
      "text": "我开动了！嗯～……太好吃了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:590af2ec5b4c7f0aec1c4c595966758eabf09b4bcb2e6b715e37fe42bfe68737",
      "text": "英雄先生吃得看起来真香啊！\n充分传达出您有多喜欢松饼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b06772fcc86d4828460a60fdf3101fd383cdc0ae64149c986f1274448310b110",
      "text": "是、是吗？总觉得有点不好意思啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51dcf4f501717270d7190bd94fe1fb3543eda3591744540f63b781c8ca6f56cd",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー，\n能把那边的枫糖浆递给我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7952aa8ffa11fc789b3e00bea53e969eeedbecd2086456580ff9fff9cce0c488",
      "text": "好的，给您。\n您也很喜欢枫糖浆吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48b4c1d32d7bd6cd8c2afa2a40d00217876eea26199c0fe6c37383052e8e35cb",
      "text": "是啊。我就喜欢这种吃法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:668cde065a638b6d615371e37608e07589215bb69f327eef580cb6efb706cf83",
      "text": "在松饼上淋上满满的枫糖浆\n再吃下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8093c0fb5b6bb6e82aafabe532c11d8004ab2b9df3f6fe84a85aee303f2a261",
      "text": "这松饼本身就很好吃，制作人吃了之后，\n肯定也会露出跟我一样的表情的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2043256021f02eeb81a354743a8c48e6b2efb3d37ef0d7e6935a1194769c235",
      "text": "松饼真美味呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419a9e94a1c3bbe564dfa20556c197e4ba3249ed81bcfe49f241ef457b9f93ef",
      "text": "就是说啊。工作也很顺利，\n今天真是好事连连的一天啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e8a6220f9d169a49c3f4b14383fabac82d1d00aac265dd7480b8e58031ac04f",
      "text": "……啊，对了。\n能稍微等我一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d019fd5363c1f3928328aa99c6168f7f20365b07beb6457a386761b744970d3",
      "text": "拍得挺不错的嘛。把这个这样弄一下……\n好，更新完毕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd5428807876749623837c86b2e2e4a24b9419c5d59134d40c17cac68a64f8eb",
      "text": "更新，是指什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52666df53e50962e20896a5bd6b49c5e0e58755c312e0e40cf4617801b56a01b",
      "text": "是LINK的头像啦。\n换成刚才去的松饼店的招牌了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6d8061faf58d194d051263340ac08fbbe8047f430abc8f78d42e1af1342d3cf",
      "text": "看到这张照片，\n那些家伙肯定更想来了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a404888f340449d6a529fff7b925460e7d4f75811e47c2d5c083e20df70a2d6",
      "text": "是说弟弟们吧！\n下次务必带他们来一次哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
